e pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Cottonwood</b> tree is one of the trees that can be found in <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay\" title=\"Finlay\">Finlay</a> near river. It appears as a tall thick tree, with brown-muted copper trunk that branches out into several smaller limbs supporting large clusters of leaves.\n</p><p>Like every other material in-game, it can be used to complete schematics.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Textures\">Textures</span></h2><p>\nThe various textures of the <b>Cottonwood</b> in its raw/log, sanded, and planked states.</p><div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"9f78881edab3d290d143462d0cbaa0a9\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:102px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:102px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"CottonwoodLogT-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:95px; width:100px; top:2.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:CottonwoodLogT.png\" title=\"CottonwoodLogT.png (88 KB)\" style=\"height:95px; width:100px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/98/CottonwoodLogT.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20260628150517\" title=\"CottonwoodLogT.png (88 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Log\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" data-image-name=\"CottonwoodLogT.png\" data-image-key=\"CottonwoodLogT.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Log\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"CottonwoodLogT.png (88 KB)\" class